  "_comment": "Gem frames (GDD §6.2). A frame is a recipe, not code (docs/M1_PLAN.md D33): it names which registered effect atoms it rolls and the range each rolls in, per tier. Crafting reads this in S4; S3 authors it and validates it. Only the four modify-phase frames are here — CHARGE, SPEND, SIPHON, ECHO, WARD and LINGER all accumulate across a fight and arrive with the react phase in S4, together with the atoms they need. Every frame carries a real drawback, which §6.2 requires and §10 explains: a pure upgrade creates a known-correct ranking, which is the meta this design exists to avoid. Ranges are provisional and are what the S8 balance pass moves first.",
